    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1025">

                <pb facs="1124" n="1112" sameAs="frus:frus1944v03/pg1112"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">863.01/2458</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Robert D. Murphy, Political Adviser, Allied Force
                        Headquarters, to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 519</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Algiers</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-05-15">May 15,
                        1944</date>.<lb/>[Received May 26—9:18 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to my despatch 483 of April
                    27, 1944<anchor n="46" xml:id="d1025-f1"/> which contained a discussion of
                    Soviet policy in Italy and of the present position of the Italian Communist
                    Party particularly as seen by Count Sforza, I have the honor to transmit as of
                    interest to the Department copy of a memorandum reporting the strength of the
                    Communist Party in influencing politics in Allied occupied Italy and the
                    influence of the Soviet Union in determining the policy of the Party.</p>
                <p>This memorandum, dated April 19, 1944, was prepared by the Political Section of
                    the Allied Control Commission for Italy.</p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert</hi> D. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Murphy</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d1025-a1.xml" xpointer="d1025-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
